---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
	<section class="hero">
		<p class="eyebrow">Personal Homepage</p>
		<p class="name">김서영 <span>Seoyeong Kim</span></p>
		<h1>Hamo의 배움과 기록을 모으는 공간</h1>
		<p class="intro">
			더 쉽게, 더 깊게 읽는 Swift velog를 통해 배움의 행복을 전달하고
			있습니다.
		</p>
		<div class="actions" aria-label="Planned sections">
			<a href="/about/">About</a>
			<a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
			<a href="/posts/">Posts</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="next-steps" aria-labelledby="next-steps-title">
		<h2 id="next-steps-title">앞으로 채워갈 섹션</h2>
		<div class="section-grid">
			<article>
				<h3>About</h3>
				<p>김서영이라는 사람, Hamo라는 닉네임, 배우고 기록하는 방식을 소개합니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>Projects</h3>
				<p>Swift와 웹, 개인 프로젝트를 정리하고 과정에서 배운 점을 남깁니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3>Posts</h3>
				<p>velog 글과 새롭게 쓰는 노트를 모아 오래 꺼내 읽을 수 있게 정리합니다.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.hero {
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: #4d6f92;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.name {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: #2a2d31;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.name span {
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
		color: #717982;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 15ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 7vw, 6rem);
		line-height: 1.05;
		word-break: keep-all;
	}

	.intro {
		max-width: 37rem;
		margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
		color: #4b535c;
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 2.25rem;
	}

	.actions a {
		border: 1px solid #d9dde2;
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		background: #ffffff;
		color: #2f363d;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.actions a:hover {
		border-color: #4d6f92;
		color: #294e75;
	}

	.next-steps {
		margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
		border-top: 1px solid #e6e8eb;
		padding-top: 2rem;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.section-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	article {
		border-top: 1px solid #e6e8eb;
		padding-top: 1rem;
	}

	h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	article p {
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		color: #59616b;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.site-header {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		nav {
			justify-content: flex-start;
		}

		h1 {
			max-width: 12ch;
			font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 14vw, 4rem);
		}

		.name span {
			display: block;
			margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
		}

		.section-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
